D021 DC04             (    forth6809.asm):02592                     LDD   LATEST
D023 3406             (    forth6809.asm):02593                     PSHS  D
                      (    forth6809.asm):02594         
D025 CCD483           (    forth6809.asm):02595                     LDD   #INTERPRET
