DBFC 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05022                     PSHU  D                 ; See bugfix: RECURSEW.1
DBFE BDDE7F           (    forth6809.asm):05023                     JSR   CCALL
DC01 39               (    forth6809.asm):05024                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):05025         
